{"id":34601376095,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAIDmcZXw","head_branch":"DHIS2-20927-sequential-te-export","head_sha":"0c235f0ca6d82099d24fdb614a5ec14effbfcb33","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":52641,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"perf: run tracked entity export fetches in series DHIS2-20927","status":"completed","conclusion":"cancelled","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":93731507860,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAV0tVOlA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34601376095","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34601376095","pull_requests":[{"id":4506015450,"number":25176,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/pulls/25176","head":{"ref":"DHIS2-20927-sequential-te-export","sha":"3829c607814cfcdd1152614d3fb5810c6a354aea","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}},"base":{"ref":"master","sha":"36edf830ca826ac071de42f4160a1180488eac00","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}}}],"created_at":"2026-09-11T12:54:33Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T12:55:37Z","run_started_at":"2026-09-11T12:54:33Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34601376095/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34601376095/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/93731507860","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34601376095/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34601376095/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34601376095/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"perf: run tracked entity export fetches in series DHIS2-20927\n\nTrackedEntityAggregate.find() fanned its four fetches onto a JVM-wide\nunbounded cached thread pool. Measurement shows the fan-out is ~3% of\nrequest time and that sequential execution matches it on p95 and\nthroughput, so the parallelism buys nothing while costing four\nconnections and four threads per request -- four threads even when\nfields means three branches do no DB work.\n\nRun the four fetches in series on the request thread instead, with the\nsame conditionals and the same merge. MDC and deadline propagation are\nno longer needed since execution never leaves the request thread, and\nDeadlineAwareJdbcTemplate still re-reads the shrinking budget per\nstatement.\n\nEnrollmentAggregate no longer obtains and clears authentication.\nClearing in a finally is safe on a throwaway pooled thread, but inline\nit wipes the caller's own SecurityContext and fails every later step of\nthe request with \"No authentication found\".\n\nDelete ThreadPoolManager so the unbounded pool cannot be reused, and\ndrop Context.userDetails, which only existed to carry authentication\nonto the pooled threads.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"},"id":"0c235f0ca6d82099d24fdb614a5ec14effbfcb33","tree_id":"6e9fc0eccdce899c8df30462cd0f8b98ed7fdf19","timestamp":"2026-09-11T12:53:52Z","committer":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users